OL,3,AJimmy McGovern claims young offender
OL,4,Ainstitution staff 'lazy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA BAFTA-winning screenwriter whose new
OL,7,Fdrama is set in a young offender
OL,8,Finstitution has said he believed
OL,9,Fkeeping inmates isolated from each
OL,10,Fother for long periods allowed staff to
OL,11,F"sit on their backsides all day and do
OL,12,Fnothing".
OL,14,FJimmy McGovern, writer of BBC drama
OL,15,FTime, said he was shocked after
OL,16,Fvisiting "appalling" facilities while
OL,17,Fresearching the latest series.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
