OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJimmy McGovern claims young offender
OL,4,Ainstitution staff 'lazy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMcGovern told BBC North West Tonight
OL,7,Fthose in young offender institutions
OL,8,F(YOIs) were "banged up 23 hours a day"
OL,9,Fas part of a keep-apart policy to stop
OL,10,Foffenders mixing. He said he believed
OL,11,Fthe policy gave officers an "excuse for
OL,12,Fbeing lazy".
OL,14,FThe Prison Officers' Association (POA)
OL,15,Fsaid McGovern was "unfair" to call
OL,16,Fofficers lazy - and said keep-aparts
OL,17,Fwere essential for safety due to a
OL,18,Fdaily threat of serious violence.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
